                "text": "CVE-2022-27943"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2022-27943?s=debian&n=gcc-12&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "libiberty/rust-demangle.c in GNU GCC 11.2 allows stack consumption in demangle_const, as demonstrated by nm-new.\n\n---\n- gcc-12 <unfixed> (unimportant)\nNegligible security impact\nhttps://gcc.gnu.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=105039\n",
                "markdown": "> libiberty/rust-demangle.c in GNU GCC 11.2 allows stack consumption in demangle_const, as demonstrated by nm-new.\n\n---\n- gcc-12 <unfixed> (unimportant)\nNegligible security impact\nhttps://gcc.gnu.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=105039\n\n|                                                                                                           |\n|Package         pkg:deb/debian/gcc-12@12.2.0-14%2Bdeb12u1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12  |\n|Affected range  >0                                                                                         |\n|Fixed version   not fixed                                                                                  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
