              "help": {
                "text": "In libxml2 before 2.15.4, xmlFAParsePosCharGroup has an out-of-bounds read, aka an out-of-bounds read in the NXT macro in xmlregexp.\n\n---\n- libxml2 2.15.4+dfsg-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1146744)\nhttps://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2/-/work_items/1099\nFixed by: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2/-/commit/76fe08d97de88bfaef2f7d5cd27f11954cc5bee2 (v2.15.4)\n",
