              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-42507?s=golang&n=stdlib&t=golang&vr=%3C1.25.11",
              "help": {
                "text": "When returning errors, functions in the net/textproto package would include its input as part of the error. This might allow an attacker to inject misleading content to errors that are printed or logged.\n",
                "markdown": "> When returning errors, functions in the net/textproto package would include its input as part of the error. This might allow an attacker to inject misleading content to errors that are printed or logged.\n\n|                                          |\n|Package         pkg:golang/stdlib@1.24.6  |\n|Affected range  <1.25.11                  |\n|Fixed version   1.25.11                   |\n"
