            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-39826",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-39826"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-39826?s=golang&n=stdlib&t=golang&vr=%3C1.25.10",
              "help": {
                "text": "If a trusted template author were to write a <script> tag containing an empty 'type' attribute or a 'type' attribute with an ASCII whitespace, the execution of the template would incorrectly escape any data passed into the <script> block.\n",
                "markdown": "> If a trusted template author were to write a <script> tag containing an empty 'type' attribute or a 'type' attribute with an ASCII whitespace, the execution of the template would incorrectly escape any data passed into the <script> block.\n\n|                                          |\n|Package         pkg:golang/stdlib@1.24.6  |\n|Affected range  <1.25.10                  |\n|Fixed version   1.25.10                   |\n"
