              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-56858?s=golang&n=stdlib&t=golang&vr=%3C1.25.13",
              "help": {
                "text": "Previously, pathological inputs could close an unescaped '/' early, allowing for attack-controlled data to inject arbitrary content, potentially leading to XSS.\n",
